{"availability":"available","full":"calebponce/Layover-Plus","name":"Layover-Plus","description":"Explainable, risk-aware layover planner with deterministic safety rules, AI-assisted ranking, and a live interactive demo.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-14T19:24:59Z","updated":"2026-09-23T04:31:17Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://calebponce.github.io/Layover-Plus/","topics":["express","generative-ai","github-pages","itinerary-planner","nodejs","playwright","portfolio-project","pwa","react","travel","travel-tech"],"demo":"https://calebponce.github.io/Layover-Plus/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:28.407Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:28.407Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:28.407Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T05:44:28.407Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Risk-aware micro-itineraries for airport layovers, built with React, Express, Gemini, OpenStreetMap, and Playwright.","LayoverPlus answers a deceptively difficult travel question: is there enough time to leave the airport, enjoy one nearby stop, and return without gambling on the next flight? It turns flight timing, airport-specific buffers, traveler risk tolerance, routing estimates, and nearby places into a timestamped plan with an explainable go/no-go recommendation.","Try the live portfolio demo — no account, API key, or paid service required. The demo uses representative route data and runs the deterministic safety engine entirely in the browser."],"features":["Safety logic stays deterministic. Gemini can rank feasible candidates and improve wording, but it cannot override processing time, return buffers, feasibility math, or risk labels. Fast boundary tests prove that an…","The AI boundary has a repeatable offline evaluation set. Versioned synthetic responses exercise feasible and infeasible picks, schedule tampering, unsupported claims, malformed JSON, and provider failures without an API…","The product degrades gracefully. If Gemini is unavailable or exceeds a bounded request deadline, the API returns deterministic narrative guidance. If live POI or route services fail, curated destinations and…","Choices remain synchronized. Selecting another destination replans the recommendation, timeline, and map as one state transition; Playwright verifies that behavior end to end.","The API exposes its reasoning. Responses include score components, effective buffers, selection source, AI metadata, latency, and map-service runtime counters."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/calebponce/Layover-Plus/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b787e59dbf1eaf46dc9f1c7f989cc5b9890449202db5f919d2758d71fae44e7b","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:28.578Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:28.578Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Risk-aware micro-itineraries for airport layovers, built with React, Express, Gemini, OpenStreetMap, and Playwright.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/calebponce/Layover-Plus/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"> Try the live portfolio demo — no account, API key, or paid service required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/calebponce/Layover-Plus/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"not_required","text":"> Try the live portfolio demo — no account, API key, or paid service required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/calebponce/Layover-Plus/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"> Try the live portfolio demo — no account, API key, or paid service required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/calebponce/Layover-Plus/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"b787e59dbf1eaf46dc9f1c7f989cc5b9890449202db5f919d2758d71fae44e7b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/calebponce/Layover-Plus/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:28.578Z"},"overviewRepoUp